    "id":  15387,
    "title":  "Band-9 Samples: Do you play any games? [Why/Why not?]",
    "slug":  "cambridge-ielts-9-academic-speaking-part-1-question-2-test-1-samples-band-9",
    "link":  "https://engnovate.com/cambridge-ielts-9-academic-speaking-part-1-question-2-test-1-samples-band-9/",
    "date":  "2023-08-13T17:44:05",
    "content":  "\n\u003cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"\u003eThis post contains ideas and band-9 sample answers (audio included) for the\u0026nbsp;\u003cem\u003eCambridge IELTS 9 Academic Speaking Part 1 Question 2 Test 1\u003c/em\u003e\u0026nbsp;question:\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003e“Do you play any games? [Why/Why not?]”\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"\u003eSample 1: Yes\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/cambridge-ielts-9-academic-speaking-part-1-question-2-test-1-samples-band-9-female-voice-1.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eFemale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/cambridge-ielts-9-academic-speaking-part-1-question-2-test-1-samples-band-9-male-voice-1.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eMale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"\u003eIndeed, I play video games quite regularly. I believe they\u0026#8217;re more than just a form of entertainment, they\u0026#8217;re a form of art. The intricate storylines, stunning graphics, and complex mechanics make each game a unique experience. Plus, it\u0026#8217;s a great way to unwind after a long day.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"\u003eSample 2: Yes\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/cambridge-ielts-9-academic-speaking-part-1-question-2-test-1-samples-band-9-female-voice-2.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eFemale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/cambridge-ielts-9-academic-speaking-part-1-question-2-test-1-samples-band-9-male-voice-2.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eMale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"\u003eYes, our family enjoys playing games together, especially during family gatherings. Our favorite is Monopoly; it\u0026#8217;s a fun way to teach the younger ones about money management. Besides, it gives us a chance to strengthen our bond, share laughs, and create lasting memories.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"\u003eSample 3: Yes\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/cambridge-ielts-9-academic-speaking-part-1-question-2-test-1-samples-band-9-female-voice-3.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eFemale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/cambridge-ielts-9-academic-speaking-part-1-question-2-test-1-samples-band-9-male-voice-3.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eMale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"\u003eYes, I\u0026#8217;m an avid chess player. The reason behind my fascination is the intellectual stimulation it provides. Unlike many other pastimes, it\u0026#8217;s not just about luck but strategy and critical thinking. It\u0026#8217;s like a battle of wits, making every move crucial. The thrill of predicting your opponent\u0026#8217;s moves and forming a counter-strategy is immensely rewarding.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"\u003eSample 4: Yes\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/cambridge-ielts-9-academic-speaking-part-1-question-2-test-1-samples-band-9-female-voice-4.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eFemale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/cambridge-ielts-9-academic-speaking-part-1-question-2-test-1-samples-band-9-male-voice-4.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eMale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"\u003eYes, I do play games, specifically virtual reality (VR) games. They offer an immersive experience that traditional games can\u0026#8217;t match. It\u0026#8217;s fascinating how you can explore different worlds and live out various scenarios. It\u0026#8217;s like a form of escapism, allowing me to take a break from reality.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"\u003eSample 5: Yes\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/cambridge-ielts-9-academic-speaking-part-1-question-2-test-1-samples-band-9-female-voice-5.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eFemale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/cambridge-ielts-9-academic-speaking-part-1-question-2-test-1-samples-band-9-male-voice-5.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eMale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"\u003eIndeed, I engage in games, notably those with an educational bent. I see them as a dynamic alternative to conventional learning techniques. They render learning more hands-on, captivating, and enjoyable. For instance, I use language learning games to bolster my vocabulary and pronunciation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"\u003eSample 6: No\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/cambridge-ielts-9-academic-speaking-part-1-question-2-test-1-samples-band-9-female-voice-6.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eFemale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/cambridge-ielts-9-academic-speaking-part-1-question-2-test-1-samples-band-9-male-voice-6.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eMale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"\u003eI would love to engage in games, but unfortunately, my hectic schedule doesn\u0026#8217;t allow me to. Between my full-time job and my studies, I barely have any leisure time. When I do get some free time, I prefer to use it for relaxation or catching up on some much-needed sleep.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"\u003eSample 7: No\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/cambridge-ielts-9-academic-speaking-part-1-question-2-test-1-samples-band-9-female-voice-7.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eFemale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/cambridge-ielts-9-academic-speaking-part-1-question-2-test-1-samples-band-9-male-voice-7.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eMale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"\u003eI\u0026#8217;m not particularly fond of board games or video games, instead, I\u0026#8217;m a huge fan of outdoor activities. There\u0026#8217;s something about feeling the wind against your face and the adrenaline rush you get from sports like mountain biking or rock climbing. They not only keep me physically fit but also mentally refreshed.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"\u003eSample 8: No\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/cambridge-ielts-9-academic-speaking-part-1-question-2-test-1-samples-band-9-female-voice-8.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eFemale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/cambridge-ielts-9-academic-speaking-part-1-question-2-test-1-samples-band-9-male-voice-8.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eMale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"\u003eTo be candid, I don\u0026#8217;t partake much in games. I don\u0026#8217;t particularly relish competitive situations, which are often a component of many games. I\u0026#8217;m more inclined towards collaborative activities where the emphasis is on collective effort rather than one-upmanship.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"\u003eSample 9: No\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/cambridge-ielts-9-academic-speaking-part-1-question-2-test-1-samples-band-9-female-voice-9.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eFemale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/cambridge-ielts-9-academic-speaking-part-1-question-2-test-1-samples-band-9-male-voice-9.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eMale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"\u003eI must admit that I don\u0026#8217;t play games of any sort. It\u0026#8217;s not that I don\u0026#8217;t appreciate them, but I have a strong inclination towards maintaining a healthy lifestyle. I\u0026#8217;ve read studies linking prolonged gaming with sedentary habits and poor health outcomes, so I prefer to spend my free time in more physically active pursuits.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"\u003eSample 10: No\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/cambridge-ielts-9-academic-speaking-part-1-question-2-test-1-samples-band-9-female-voice-10.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eFemale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure class=\"wp-block-audio\"\u003e\u003caudio controls src=\"https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/cambridge-ielts-9-academic-speaking-part-1-question-2-test-1-samples-band-9-male-voice-10.mp3\"\u003e\u003c/audio\u003e\u003cfigcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"\u003eMale\u003c/figcaption\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cp class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"\u003eTo be completely honest, I don\u0026#8217;t play games. I’m an introverted person and value my alone time. I prefer solitary activities, like reading, which allow me to delve into different worlds, expand my horizons, and explore ideas at my own pace.\u003c/p\u003e\n",
    "excerpt":  "\u003cp\u003eThis post contains ideas and band-9 sample answers (audio included) for the\u0026nbsp;Cambridge IELTS 9 Academic Speaking Part 1 Question 2 Test 1\u0026nbsp;question: “Do you play any games? [Why/Why not?]” Sample 1: Yes Indeed, I play video games quite regularly. I believe they\u0026#8217;re more than just a form of entertainment, they\u0026#8217;re a form of art. The [\u0026hellip;]\u003c/p\u003e\n"
}
